### repository_manifests
- repo_id (unique)
- repo_path
- status
- timestamps

### indexing_jobs
- job_id
- job_key (unique)
- repo_id
- status (QUEUED, IN_PROGRESS, RETRYABLE, FAILED, COMPLETED)
- leased_by
- lease_until
- attempts
- error_message
- timestamps

